## What is deliberately absent

supertoolkit ships **no OAuth client id** for any provider. A shared client id
would make every installation look like the same application to the provider,
which is both a privacy problem for operators and a single point of revocation
for everyone. You register your own; see the README.

It also ships no telemetry, no update check and no network calls of its own. The
only hosts it contacts are the providers you connect and the token endpoints
those providers publish.
